    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "={{ $json.mission }}",
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "You are Alex Prime, the CEO Agent of an AI organisation. Your job is to:\n1. Understand the incoming mission or task.\n2. Decide which executive agents to delegate to: CTO, COO, and/or CMO.\n3. Return ONLY a raw JSON object. No markdown. No backticks. No explanation.\n\nThe route field MUST always be a JSON array, even if only one value.\n\nExample output:\n{\n  \"route\": [\"CTO\", \"CMO\"],\n  \"cto_task\": \"Build an API integration spec\",\n  \"coo_task\": null,\n  \"cmo_task\": \"Write launch announcement copy\",\n  \"summary\": \"We need both technical implementation and marketing comms.\"\n}\n\nIf only one department is needed:\n{\n  \"route\": [\"CTO\"],\n  \"cto_task\": \"Build the claims API\",\n  \"coo_task\": null,\n  \"cmo_task\": null,\n  \"summary\": \"This is a technical task only.\"\n}"
        }
      },
      "id": "95d45079-e569-475f-89b5-fc3ad9d9d402",
      "name": "CEO Agent (Alex Prime)",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent",
      "typeVersion": 1.7,
      "position": [-900, 220]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const raw = $input.first().json.output || '{}';\nlet parsed;\nconst cleaned = raw.replace(/```json/gi, '').replace(/```/g, '').trim();\ntry {\n  parsed = JSON.parse(cleaned);\n} catch(e) {\n  parsed = { route: [], summary: raw };\n}\nif (!parsed.route) {\n  parsed.route = [];\n} else if (typeof parsed.route === 'string') {\n  parsed.route = parsed.route.split(',').map(s => s.trim());\n}\nreturn [{ json: parsed }];"
      },
      "id": "e2d45d2a-a2e7-45e1-a2c8-2b0aa5ee8245",
      "name": "Parse CEO Routing",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
